    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip, i'll check the pantry. but it's just so weird... it doesn't look like bugs or anything, like no wings or legs or nothing, just these little weird shapes or clumps that seem to appear out of nowhere. it almost feels like they're just... hiding in the shadows or something, waiting for a moment when i'm not paying attention to just pop up and ruin the batch. do you think it could be something else, like something more subtle that's just lurking in the equipment or the cracks? something that's hard to catch?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
